# Anchor: per-model settings for Aider + Ollama-served Qwen3 (swarm-local).
# Copy this file to `.aider.model.settings.yml` (machine-local; Anchor's
# gitignore block already covers it) and change `name:` to the model you serve.
#
# Why this file exists: thinking mode for an Ollama-served model can NOT be set
# from `.aider.conf.yml` or typed into chat.
#
# 1. Thinking off. Qwen3's `/no_think` message suffix is a chat-template
#    convention that Ollama did not honor on the builds measured (0.34.0 and
#    0.34.2, 2026-09: a one-word prompt with `/no_think` still emitted
#    reasoning). The switch that worked is the API-level `think: false`. Aider passes `extra_params` to
#    litellm, and litellm's Ollama transform maps `reasoning_effort` to that flag:
#    `reasoning_effort` outside {"low", "medium", "high"} sends `think: false`
#    (litellm/llms/ollama/chat/transformation.py, verified through litellm
#    1.81.10 as vendored by aider 0.86.2). `none` is used below. That mapping is
#    a litellm implementation detail: if a later litellm changes it, re-check
#    with `curl $OLLAMA/api/chat -d '{..., "think": false}'` -- a clean answer
#    with no `thinking` field is the behavior this line is asking for.
#
# 2. Context window (optional, off by default). Aider 0.86.2 already sizes
#    `num_ctx` for Ollama models on every request (about 1.25x the prompt's
#    tokens + 8192, aider/models.py) unless `extra_params` sets it, so Aider is
#    not silently truncated to Ollama's default window the way a raw request is.
#    A fixed `num_ctx` overrides that sizing: it keeps the window constant, but a
#    prompt larger than the value you pick would be truncated. Only uncomment it
#    if you want that, and match it to the window your model actually serves
#    (the fleet registry records it as `max_context`).
#
# Servers other than Ollama (llama.cpp, vLLM) do not take `reasoning_effort` as
# an Ollama `think` flag; whether `/no_think` works there was not measured here.
- name: ollama_chat/qwen3:8b
  edit_format: diff
  extra_params:
    reasoning_effort: none
    # num_ctx: 8192
